---
import App from "$layouts/App.astro";
---

<App>
	<div class="flex items-center justify-center h-[90vh]">
		<div class="flex max-sm:flex-col sm:items-end gap-20 sm:gap-28 max-w-4xl w-full max-sm:mx-4">
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center">
				<span class="w-42 h-42 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
					<img src="/favicon.jpg" alt="Avatar" draggable="false" class="inline-block w-full h-full rounded-full object-cover" />
				</span>

				<strong class="flex gap-2 mt-10 text-xl font-serif tracking-widest">
					<ruby>五月七日<rp>（</rp><rt>つゆり</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>
					<ruby>千緒<rp>（</rp><rt>ちお</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>
				</strong>

				<div class="flex gap-10 mt-4 text-xl">
					<a href="https://github.com/tuyuritio" target="_blank" aria-label="GitHub" title="Browse projects" class="inline-flex"><i class="iconify lucide--github"></i></a>
					<a href={`mailto:[${btoa("i@57t.io")}]`} aria-label="Email" title="Get in touch" class="inline-flex"><i class="iconify lucide--at-sign"></i></a>
					<a href="https://ttio.cc" target="_blank" aria-label="Blog" title="Explore thoughts" class="inline-flex"><i class="iconify lucide--audio-waveform"></i></a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<article class="flex flex-col gap-12 mb-10">
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
					<p>Hi, I'm <strong><ruby>五月七日<rp>(</rp><rt>Tuyuri</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>千緒<rp>(</rp><rt>Tio</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></strong>. Just <strong>Tio</strong> is fine.</p>
					<p>It’s hard to say that programming is my hobby, but I really enjoy the process of creating and solving things with code.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="text-selection">
					<p>// Understanding asynchronously...</p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</App>
